+# Best AI Tools for Small Businesses in 2026
+
+[![Awesome](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sindresorhus/awesome@main/media/badge.svg)](https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome)
+[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
+![Topics](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/GagnDeep/awesome-best-ai-tools-for-small-businesses-2026?style=social)
+
+> Best AI tools for small businesses in 2026 should be affordable, flexible, and easy to control. This curated awesome list focuses only on open source projects with public GitHub repositories, making it easier to find self-hosted AI workflow tools, chat interfaces, agent frameworks, and model-serving stacks that small teams can actually evaluate, deploy, and extend.
+
+## Table of Contents
+- [TL;DR](#tldr)
+- [Why This List](#why-this-list)
+- [Open Source Tools](#open-source-tools)
+- [FAQ](#faq)
+- [Contributing](#contributing)
